## Drum and dance benefits for your team

African drums, percussion and dancing will empower and motivate your group. At the same time, the team explores rhythm dynamics, call-and-response activities and the creation of an African drumming ensemble.

Your team will learn ancient rhythms and connect with an energy that has bonded communities for aeons! We also challenge and encourage team members to focus on creating sound and movement together. Above all, you’ll have an unforgettable time with your team!

