## Team building FAQs

### Team building workshop questions

{% faq %}
{% question title="Do participants need previous drumming or dance experience?" %}
Absolutely not! We design our African drumming and dance workshops for complete beginners, so no musical or dance experience is necessary. Besides, our professional facilitators guide everyone through the activities. As a result, people of all ages, abilities and backgrounds can join in. All you need is a willingness to have a go!
{% /question %}

{% question title="What happens during a corporate drumming workshop?" %}
Our workshops are energetic, interactive and full of surprises! Each session builds from a fun warm-up to a group performance. Along the way, rhythm, teamwork and plenty of laughter bring everyone together.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Can you tailor the workshop to our event theme?" %}
Definitely! Of course, every corporate event has its own purpose and personality. So whether you’re planning a conference, staff development day, Christmas party or team retreat, we tailor the workshop to your event, group size and goals. Just tell us what you’re planning and we’ll create an experience to match.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Do you offer both African drumming and dance?" %}
Yes! We offer both African drumming and traditional West African dance workshops. You can choose drumming only, or combine drumming, singing and dance for an even more energetic event. What’s more, African dance gets everyone moving, laughing and connecting!
{% /question %}
{% /faq %}

### Travel, venues and group sizes

{% faq %}
{% question title="How many people can participate?" %}
We cater for corporate groups of all sizes, from small teams to large conferences. Whether you’re planning an intimate session or a workshop for hundreds of people, we tailor the experience to suit your group. So get in touch to discuss your numbers and we’ll work out the best approach.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Do you provide all the drums and equipment?" %}
Yes! We supply everything for your African drumming workshop, including drums, percussion instruments and equipment. Our facilitators also bring the experience, energy and guidance to make your event a success.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Can workshops run indoors or outdoors?" %}
Absolutely! In fact, we run corporate drumming workshops indoors and outdoors. For example, we work in conference venues, offices, function rooms, outdoor event spaces and retreats. We’ll also discuss your venue and setup beforehand, so everything runs smoothly.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Can you travel to our corporate event?" %}
Yes, we travel to you! After all, Rhythm Culture runs corporate drumming and dance workshops across Australia. Wherever your event takes place, we organise the travel and bring everything needed for your workshop.
{% /question %}
{% /faq %}
